1
00:00:00,489 --> 00:00:02,889
(Howard:)...who claims he wrote
Beverly Hills Chihuahua.

2
00:00:04,326 --> 00:00:06,696
Then you give up on love,
go to Marie Callender's...

3
00:00:06,895 --> 00:00:09,985
(Howard:)...buy a pie and eat it in your car
in the parking lot.

4
00:00:12,968 --> 00:00:15,838
- What time should I be at your mother's?
- I told her around 7.

5
00:00:18,006 --> 00:00:22,496
(Leonard:)I swear, that man is the most egotistical,
insufferable human being I have ever met.

6
00:00:23,011 --> 00:00:25,601
(Penny:)Yeah, but you two
make such a cute couple.

7
00:00:27,115 --> 00:00:28,915
Like Bert and Ernie.

8
00:00:30,252 --> 00:00:33,522
(Penny:)You guys even teach me stuff
about words and numbers.

9
00:00:34,723 --> 00:00:36,153
(Leonard:)Well, I've had it, I am done.

10
00:00:36,358 --> 00:00:38,188
I can't live with him one more minute.

11
00:00:38,393 --> 00:00:40,193
Wow, where are you gonna go?

12
00:00:40,395 --> 00:00:42,325
Well, I was thinking here with you.

13
00:00:44,933 --> 00:00:46,263
(Sheldon:)Oh.

14
00:00:47,369 --> 00:00:48,629
Is that a problem?

15
00:00:48,837 --> 00:00:51,427
No, no, no. It's great.

16
00:00:51,673 --> 00:00:54,873
It's terrific. You know, I just can't
help feel bad about Sheldon.

17
00:00:55,077 --> 00:00:58,167
I mean, how's he gonna
get by without you...

18
00:00:58,547 --> 00:01:02,027
...Ernie?

